  "segments": [
    {
      "s": 0.0,
      "e": 6.24,
      "text": "This is Jalil, and he and his team built a tool that gives small restaurants the same tech stack as all the biggest chains in the world."
    },
    {
      "s": 6.44,
      "e": 13.78,
      "text": "Two months after moving across the country to be with his girlfriend, Jalil got broken up with, fired from his job and had nothing to do but look around his new city."
    },
    {
      "s": 14.02,
      "e": 17.48,
      "text": "Then I was like, okay, you know what? Entrepreneurship. This is what we have to do."
    },
    {
      "s": 17.54,
      "e": 21.24,
      "text": "Because Jalil noticed how his local mom and pop restaurants were all shutting down."
    },
    {
      "s": 21.42,
      "e": 28.76,
      "text": "Every year, 30% of new local restaurants closed down, yet global chains like McDonald's and Burger King keep opening thousands of new locations"
    },
    {
      "s": 28.76,
      "e": 33.0,
      "text": "because they can afford to spend millions on software to manage and market their businesses."
    },
    {
      "s": 33.48,
      "e": 35.7,
      "text": "So Jalil tried to build a solution and was told"
    },
    {
      "s": 35.7,
      "e": 39.52,
      "text": "It will probably need an investment of like $500,000."
    },
    {
      "s": 39.78,
      "e": 41.0,
      "text": "It's like, where did I get $500,000?"
    },
    {
      "s": 41.38,
      "e": 43.4,
      "text": "But that's when his friend Zanya had an idea."
    },
    {
      "s": 43.6,
      "e": 50.78,
      "text": "I heard about this tool called Lovable and to be able to just write down your idea and visually see it, just that was gold for me."
    },
    {
      "s": 50.92,
      "e": 58.4,
      "text": "So with the help of his co-founder Hussain, Jalil built QuickTables, management software that lets local restaurants compete with industry giants."
    },
    {
      "s": 58.4,
      "e": 68.42,
      "text": "Really bring it down to the core. Mom and Pop style restaurants or even higher level style restaurants, they care about their food, they care about their food tasting good, they care about hungry people coming in and they're leaving well fed."
    },
    {
      "s": 68.6,
      "e": 72.84,
      "text": "What they don't care about is SEO and marketing and how their landing page looks."
    },
    {
      "s": 73.18,
      "e": 77.84,
      "text": "Fundamentally, I think it lets them focus on those things and then leave the marketing up to us."
    },
    {
      "s": 77.96,
      "e": 81.08,
      "text": "But for smaller restaurants, the rise of delivery apps created a challenge"
    },
    {
      "s": 81.08,
      "e": 84.38,
      "text": "where restaurants are left with less and less customers inside."
    },
    {
      "s": 84.38,
      "e": 87.36,
      "text": "90% of restaurant owners don't want to run a ghost kitchen."
    },
    {
      "s": 87.56,
      "e": 94.12,
      "text": "What we do instead is we create an incentive system for the customer to go and pick up the food."
    },
    {
      "s": 94.38,
      "e": 101.26,
      "text": "So you get points, you get discounts and so on and you really build a relationship with the restaurant"
    },
    {
      "s": 101.26,
      "e": 107.26,
      "text": "so that you feel more inclined to go and pick food up, maybe talk to the server, talk to the waiter, talk to the owner."
    },
    {
      "s": 107.46,
      "e": 111.92,
      "text": "Now, after a little more than a year, QuickTables is already making a huge difference."
    },
    {
      "s": 111.92,
      "e": 123.36,
      "text": "Handle maybe 700, 800k in transactions. We have clients in Sweden, Norway, Denmark, UAE."
    },
    {
      "s": 123.46,
      "e": 127.16,
      "text": "But Julio isn't doing this for the money, he's just trying to help the people around him."
    },
    {
      "s": 127.24,
      "e": 132.24,
      "text": "Just ask people, ask people you like, we work, tell them what problems are you having."
    },
    {
      "s": 132.62,
      "e": 135.98,
      "text": "I'm having these problems, okay, let's solve them together, let's go on this great journey."
    },
    {
      "s": 136.12,
      "e": 138.36,
      "text": "Maybe that is the moral of the story."
    }
  ]
}
